[ti:Week03-Fri.mp3]

[00:00.00]agent 熟义 n. 代理人，代理商；动因；施动者 示例 ① A real estate agent, attracted to his current job because he loves fixing up old homes, describes buying properties that need a little tender loving care to make them more saleable. 一个房地产代理商因为喜欢修理旧房子而被吸引做现在的工作，他描述房产购买时说，这些房产需要一些温柔的呵护以使它们更容易卖掉。（2007. 6）② He is our agent in New York. 他是我们在纽约的代理商。
[00:08.44]continual 熟义 a. 多次重复的，频繁的；接连不断的 示例 ① The continual speeding up of bodily reactions and production of stress-related hormones seem to make people more susceptible to heart disease. 这种持续加速的身体反应和与压力相关的荷尔蒙的产生似乎都会使人更易患心脏疾病。（2008. 12） ② Tom is in a continual process of rewriting his composition. 汤姆一直在不断地改写他的作文。
[00:16.43]dependent 熟义 a. 依靠的，依赖的 示例 ① As with many gender gaps, differences in emotionality tend to be small, inconsistent, and dependent on the situation. 正如许多性别差异一样，男性与女性之间的情感差异往往很微小、易变，并且常常视情况而定。（2010. 12）② You can't be dependent on your family all your life. 你不可能一辈子依靠家人生活。
[00:23.40]diplomatic 熟义 a. 外交的，从事外交的；有手腕的，灵活变通的 示例 ① Impressively, India apparently did not consider withdrawing from a four-year diplomatic effort to "normalise" its relations with Pakistan. 令人难忘地，印度显然不会考虑从为实现与巴基斯坦关系“正常化”而开展了四年的外交努力中倒退回来。（The Economist） ② Various attempts are being made to restore diplomatic relations with Japan. 正在尝试各种方法以恢复与日本的外交关系。
[00:32.57]authorise 熟义 v. 批准，授权，委任 示例 ① Most weeks they stage marches, often unauthorised, in Santiago, the capital. 大多周里他们未经批准就在首都圣地亚哥示威游行。（The Economist） ② I have authorised him to act for me while I am away for America on business. 我已委任他在我去美国出差期间代理我的职务。
[00:38.88]liberty 熟义 n. 自由(尤指政治、法律上的自由) 示例 ① After just a week of heart-stirring popular defiance has Iran's new-found spirit of liberty already been broken? 在仅仅持续了一个星期的振奋人心的公众抗议之后，伊朗新发现的自由精神就夭折了吗？（The Economist） ② The right to vote should be a liberty enjoyed by all. 投票权应当是人人享有的合法权利。
[00:46.03]retail 熟义 n. 零售‖v. 零售 示例 ① Dawn worked as a manager for a large retail clothing store for several years. 唐曾经在一家大型服装零售店里做过几年经理。（2007. 6） ② The book retails at $20. 这本书的零售价为20美元。
[00:50.44]multiple 熟义 a. 数量多的，多种多样的 示例 ① Japan would need a large multiple of the few immigrants it has at present. 日本现在移民尚少，届时它对移民的需求会更多。（2010. 12）② He has suffered multiple injuries in the accident. 这次事故使他身体多处受伤。
[00:55.67]transfer 熟义 v. (使)转移；调动；(旅途中)换乘‖n. 转移；(旅途中) 换乘 示例 ① If there was a greater coordination of technology transfer offices within regions and a simultaneous investment in the scale and functions of our graduate schools, universities could, and should, play a key role in positioning the UK for the next growth cycle. 如果各地区的技术转让部门能加强协调，同时投资扩大研究生院的规模和功能，大学将能够并且应该在下一个经济增长周期为英国的定位发挥关键作用。（2011. 12）② The film studio is transferring from Beijing to Shanghai. 这家电影制片厂将从北京迁往上海。
[01:07.84]indulge 熟义 v. 沉湎，沉溺(于…) 示例 ① Most educators advise that kids should not indulge themselves in computer games. 大部分教育家建议小孩子不要沉溺于电脑游戏。（2010. 6）② She went into town to indulge in some serious shopping. 她进城去大肆购物。
[01:13.15]grip 熟义 n. 紧握‖v. 紧握，紧抓 示例 ① But like many in the publishing industry, the paper is in the grip of a serious financial crisis. 然而，与出版业的许多同行一样，该报（The New York Times）也因为一场严重的金融危机而严重受挫。（2010. 12）② She asked me to keep a tight grip on the rope. 她让我抓紧绳索。
[01:19.37]groan 熟义 v. 呻吟，叹息‖n. 呻吟声，叹息声 示例 ① We kept waiting for a stutter, cough, stumble or, at least, some kind of motorised groan. But the Cruze Turbo Diesel was the little engine that could— offering not even a trace of strain up Mine Hill Road. 我们一直等待着出现时断时续、吱吱作响、蹒跚而行的情况，或者至少发出类似发动机的呻吟。但是配有涡轮增压柴油机的雪佛兰科鲁兹是为数不多的可以毫不费力地爬上煤矿山公路的汽车。（The Washington Post）② He lay on the bed, groaning with pain. 他躺在床上，痛苦地呻吟着。
[01:29.68]clue 熟义 n. 线索；提示 示例 ① Any such far-reaching intervention is bound to leave clues in the body. 这些影响深远的生理干涉一定会在身体上留下痕迹。（The Economist）② The police think the videotape may hold some vital clues to the identity of the murderer. 警方认为那盘录像带可能录有能确认杀人犯身份的一些重要线索。
[01:36.20]visualise 熟义 v. 使形象化，想象，构想 示例 ① Visualise your screenplay and write it according to what you want your audience to see and hear in your movie script. 设想你的电影剧本，并按照你希望观众在剧本中看到的和听到的东西来写。（www.ehow.com）② Visualise what you are doing in 5 years. 想象一下五年后你将做什么。
[01:42.72]site 熟义 n. (建筑物、城镇等的)地点；现场；网站，站点‖vt. 使坐落在…；为…选址 示例 ① During January, Hartwick runs a four-week course during which students may earn three to four credits on or off campus, including a number of international sites. 一月份，哈特威克学院会开设一门为期四周的课程，学生可以获得 3~4个学分——学生可以身在校内，也可以身在校外，甚至可以通过一些国际性网站来上课。（2012. 6） ② This architecture is the site of a sixteenth century abbey. 这个建筑的位置是十六世纪一座修道院的旧址。
[01:52.75]arise 熟义 v. (尤指问题或困境)出现；产生，发展 示例 ① Third, the Bank of Greece owes the ECB about C100 billion in so-called Target2 debts, which have arisen through Target2 payments system as local banks made up for the drain of deposits out of Greece by borrowing from the central bank. 其三，希腊银行亏欠ECB约1000亿欧元的所谓“目标2”债务——即希腊地方银行出于国内存款枯竭而通过“目标2”支付体系从欧洲中央银行举债。（The Economist） ② A new crisis has arisen in America. 美国已经出现了新的危机。
[02:03.21]efficient 熟义 a. 有能力的，效率高的 示例 ① That's partially because it appears that people who set realistic goals actually work more efficiently, and exert more effort, to achieve those goals. 部分原因是因为设定现实目标的人实际上工作似乎会更有效，而且会付出更多的努力去完成这些目标。（2012. 6）② The efficient use of energy is of core importance to the environment. 能源的高效利用对环境来说至关重要。
[02:11.68]benevolent 熟义 a. 慈善的，行善的 示例 ① Of course officials on both sides adamantly deny there is any rivalry at all, and stress that the two are more like loving, if competitive, siblings, with a single benevolent parent. 当然，双方政府都坚决否认之间有任何竞争并强调两者间感情更多些。如果有竞争，也是拥有同一慈爱父母的兄弟姐妹间的竞争。（The Washington Post） ② He ever holds a belief in the existence of a benevolent god. 他始终笃信仁慈的神之存在。
[02:21.14]tuck 熟义 v. (把衣服、纸张等的边缘)塞进，卷起；把…塞进狭窄的空间 示例 ① Tucked away on a trading estate in the middle of the city, the firm is surrounded by scores of small mechanical and electrical-engineering businesses. 这家公司隐蔽在市中心的一个工商业区，小型机械公司和电子工程公司遍布四周。（The Economist）② Please help me tuck up my sleeves. 请帮我卷起袖子。
[02:28.71]ambiguous 熟义 a. 模棱两可的；不明确的 示例 ① A more conclusive way for the Bank of Japan to restore calm, argues Nomura's Mr. Matsuzawa, could be to turn its hard and fast target of 2% inflation in two years into something more ambiguous. 野村证券的松泽先生认为，使日本央行恢复平静的一个更具决定性的方法可以是将其在两年内实现通货膨胀率2%这一硬性目标改成一个更模糊的目标。（The Economist） ② His account was deliberately ambiguous. 他故意陈述得含糊不清。
[02:38.12]eternal 熟义 a. 不朽的，永恒的；无休止的 示例 ① Obama said that Northern Ireland was "part of an island with which tens of millions of Americans share an eternal relationship." 奥巴马说，北爱尔兰是“与数以千万计的美国人共享永恒关系的岛国的一部分”。（USA Today） ② Chris is an eternal optimist. 克丽丝永远是个乐观主义者。
[02:44.69]appropriate 熟义 a. 合适的，恰当的 示例 ① The boss's suggestions might be appropriate, but there are always consequences. 老板的建议可能是恰当的， 但总会产生一些相应的影响。（2011. 6）② Jeans are not appropriate for formal parties. 在正式派对上穿牛仔裤不合适。
[02:50.13]elementary 熟义 a. 初级的，基础的；基本的；简单的 示例 ① The city's public high school, as well as a number of daycare centers, preschools, elementary and middle schools, fell in the lowest 10%. 该市的公立高中以及大量的托儿所、幼儿园、小学和中学落入（空气质量最差的）10%之列。（2009. 12）② Children between the ages of about 6 and 12 should go to elementary school in America. 在美国，六至十二岁的儿童要上小学。
[02:58.75]threat 熟义 n. 威胁；构成威胁的人或事物 示例 ① As the minority population grows in the United States, low college graduation rates become a threat to national prosperity. 随着美国少数民族人口的不断增长，较低的大学毕业率成为美国繁荣发展的一个威胁。（2011. 6） ② Some scholars suggest that drug abuse poses a major threat to the fabric of our society. 一些学者认为，吸毒成为我们社会结构的一大威胁。
[03:06.96]relevant 熟义 a. 紧密相关的，切题的 示例 ① We try to make the experience relevant to individual lives. 我们会尽量使这种经历与个人生活密切相关。（2011. 6）② These materials are not directly relevant to the enquiry. 这些材料与这项调查没有直接联系。
[03:12.00]grieve 熟义 v. (尤指因某人的去世而)悲伤；使悲伤，使伤心 示例 ① He grieved to death over the loss of his wife. 失去妻子使他悲痛欲绝。（2006. 12） ② He is still grieving for his father's death. 他还在为父亲的死而伤心。
[03:16.24]terror 熟义 n. 惊恐；恐怖的事；恐怖行为 示例 ① They have stayed out of Iraq's cities but have worked closely with the Iraqi police and armed forces to combat a still-potent terror threat and to help keep the peace in the fractious northern area where Kurdish and Arab territories overlap. 他们已经撤离伊拉克城区，但是与伊拉克警察和武装部队紧密合作，与仍然潜在的恐怖威胁斗争，帮助维护易发生战乱的北部地区即库尔德和阿拉伯交界地区的和平。（The Economist）② Her eyes were filled with terror. 她的眼睛里充满了恐惧。
[03:26.84]applicable 熟义 a. 适合的，适用的 示例 ① Scientists want to have a scientific discussion while those who favor faith say science is not applicable. 科学家希望进行基于科学的讨论，然而喜欢信仰的人却告诉他们科学根本就不可行。（The Guardian）② Much of the information in the form was not applicable to me. 表格中的很多信息不适用于我。
[03:33.72]logic 熟义 n. 逻辑；道理；(哲)逻辑学 示例 ① By that logic, 2006 should have been a breakthrough year for rational behaviour. 按照那个逻辑，2006年本应该是理性行为取得突破性进展的一年。（2007. 6） ② It's difficult to see the logic behind his argument. 我不大明白支持他论据的是什么逻辑。
[03:39.52]perceive 熟义 v. 意识到，察觉到；将…视为，认为 示例 ① A recurring criticism of the UK's university sector is its perceived weakness in translating new knowledge into new products and services. 不断有人批评英国大学在将新知识转化为新产品和服务方面存在明显不足。（2011. 12）② Such a discovery was perceived as a major breakthrough. 这一发现被视为一项重大突破。
[03:47.09]perception 熟义 n. 知觉，感知；看法 示例 ① So why is there such a discrepancy between the perception of immigrants' impact on the economy and the reality? 那么，人们在移民对经济影响的认识与现实之间为何会存在如此大的差异呢？（2011. 6）② Drugs can alter your perception of reality. 毒品会改变你对现实的感知。
[03:53.43]creation 熟义 n. 创造；创作 示例 ① Brin and Page meant to name their creation Googol, but someone misspelled the word so it stuck as Google. 布林和佩奇本来打算给他们的发明命名为 “Googol”，不过有人错误拼写了此单词，所以最终成了“Google”。（2007. 6） ② Their policies are all towards the further creation of wealth. 他们的政策全是为了创造更多的财富而制定。
[04:00.76]sediment 熟义 n. 沉淀物；沉积物 示例 ① They will record plant species, forest structure, ash cover, soil properties, river sediment and the overall topography of the burned area. 他们将记录被火焚毁地区的植物种类、森林结构、火山灰覆盖、土壤性质、河流沉积物和整体地势。（The Economist） ② There was a black sediment in the bottom of the bottle. 瓶子的底部有黑色的沉淀物。
[04:08.51]excessive 熟义 a. 过分的，过度的 示例 ① And earlier in the year Apple was lambasted for its use of Foxconn, a supplier under fire from labor activists for failings such as excessive working hours at its Chinese facilities. 今年早些时候，劳工维权人士严厉谴责了苹果的供应商富士康在中国分厂有迫使员工过度工作等行为，苹果也因与之合作而招来骂声一片。（The Economist） ② Excessive drinking can lead to stomach diseases. 酗酒可能引发胃病。
[04:17.59]stack 熟义 n. 堆；一大堆‖v. 堆积，堆放 示例 ① Stacked near the checkout counters, and as colourful as a Fisher-Price toy, is a not-so-serious-looking power tool: a battery-operated saw-and-drill combination. 收银台不远处堆着和费雪牌玩具一样五颜六色、看起来稍显滑稽的电动工具：一种由电池驱动、集电锯和电钻功能于一身的装备。（2013. 6） ② During the strike, workers have stacked up in the streets. 罢工期间，街上的工人越积越多。
[04:26.48]pathetic 熟义 a. 可怜的，可悲的，令人怜惜的 示例 ① So if you want to avoid the pain inflicted by the increasingly pathetic dollar, cancel that summer vacation to England and look to New England. 因此， 如果你想避免日渐凄凉的美元所带来的痛苦的话，不妨取消去英国的暑期度假计划而改去新英格兰。（2008. 6）② The protagonist of the story was a pathetic and lonely old man. 故事的主人公是个可怜又孤独的老翁。
[04:34.65]convey 熟义 v. 表达，传递(思想、感情等) 示例 ① Even allowing for his limited role in controlling the centrifuges, the president can convey the mood of his country, especially in foreign forums, such as the United Nations, and in the corridors of nuclear negotiations. 尽管总统在离心分离机的控制上作用有限，但是总统仍然可以代表国家的态度，特别是在处理联合国事务以及核谈问题上，总统的这种作用尤为突出。（The Economist） ② Please convey my apologies to your husband. 请向你的丈夫转达我的歉意。
[04:44.96]compose 熟义 v. 组成；作曲；撰写 示例 ① These organs would be entirely composed of human cells, grown by introducing them into animal hosts, and allowing them to develop into an organ in place of the animal's own. 这些器官将完全由人体细胞组成——把这些细胞注入动物寄主体内，使它们替代动物的器官长成人类的器官。（2008. 6）② The committee is composed of 12 lawyers. 委员会由十二名律师组成。
[04:53.04]commentary 熟义 n. 批评，议论 示例 ① A commentary on Utopia, a Chinese website that champions Mr. Bo, said the Walmart case had demonstrated Chongqing's "resolute attitude" towards food safety and its determination that every violation should be punished severely. 在中国的一个名为“乌托邦”的网站上，支持者波先生评论说，沃尔玛事件展示了重庆对保障食品安全的“坚决态度”和严惩每一起违规事件的决心。（The Economist） ② Would you please make some critical commentaries on the final speech of the play? 您能对这剧本结尾的台词做一些批评性的评论吗？
[05:04.69]tension 熟义 n. 紧张局势；矛盾 示例 ① It's an opportunity for relieving their tension. 这是缓解他们之间紧张关系的机会。（2011. 6） ② There is mounting international tensions. 国际紧张局势日趋严峻。
